---
import { strategySteps } from '../../data/portfolio.js';
---
<section class="slide strategy-slide" id="strategy" data-section>
  <div class="slide-inner strategy-layout">
    <aside class="dark-story strategy-intro"><div class="eyebrow light"><i></i>PRODUCT STRATEGY</div><h2>From problem framing to <span>measurable product delivery.</span></h2><p>A practical product strategy that keeps customer need, business value, feasibility, AI opportunity, automation potential and measurable outcomes connected.</p><div class="check-list"><span>Bridge customer needs with business outcomes</span><span>Data-informed, opportunity-driven prioritization</span><span>Connect roadmap to architecture and delivery</span><span>Close the loop with adoption and learning</span></div></aside>
    <div class="strategy-cycle"><div class="cycle-orbit outer"></div><div class="cycle-orbit inner"></div><div class="strategy-core"><b>PRODUCT<br/>STRATEGY</b><small>VISION · ROADMAP<br/>EXECUTION · OUTCOMES</small></div>{strategySteps.map(([n,title],i) => <div class={`strategy-step s${i+1}`}><b>{n}</b><span>{title}</span></div>)}</div>
    <aside class="strategy-outcomes"><div class="eyebrow"><i></i>STRATEGY OUTCOMES</div><article><b>01</b><strong>Higher customer satisfaction</strong><span>Journeys designed around real user value.</span></article><article><b>02</b><strong>Measurable business impact</strong><span>Success criteria connected to business metrics.</span></article><article><b>03</b><strong>Faster time to value</strong><span>Sequenced releases and focused MVPs.</span></article><article><b>04</b><strong>Scalable &amp; compliant growth</strong><span>Architecture, controls and adoption considered early.</span></article></aside>
    <div class="thin-banner">A REPEATABLE PRODUCT STRATEGY FOR ENTERPRISE IMPACT <b>→</b></div>
  </div>
</section>
